OL,4,CNew vape shop rules insult to          
OL,5,Cindustry, says owner                   
OL,6,GThe owner of three vape shops has said 
OL,7,Ghe feels "insulted" by the latest      
OL,8,Ggovernment restrictions on the sector. 
OL,10,FLast month, the Vaping Product Duty    
OL,11,Fcame into effect, imposing a rate on   
OL,12,Fbusinesses of #2.20 per 10ml of e-     
OL,13,Fliquid.                                
OL,15,FThen in the Budget, Chancellor John    
OL,16,FHealey excluded vape shops and adult   
OL,17,Fgaming centres from the new threshold  
OL,18,Ffor business rates relief.             
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
