OL,4,CYoung Muslims awarded for being        
OL,5,Ccommunity pioneers                     
OL,6,GAn inaugural awards ceremony was set   
OL,7,Gup to recognise the achievements of    
OL,8,Gyoung Muslims and challenge "negative  
OL,9,Gperspectives and stereotypes", its     
OL,10,Gfounder has said.                      
OL,12,FThe Community Pioneers Awards will     
OL,13,Ftake place on Sunday at the Chrysalis  
OL,14,FTheatre, Milton Keynes.                
OL,16,FSharif Hassan, 20, who made the city   
OL,17,Fhis home after leaving Sudan in 2020,  
OL,18,Fwill be given the Special Recognition  
OL,19,FYoung Leader Award at the ceremony.    
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
