OL,4,CA14 shut in both directions after      
OL,5,Cvehicle overturns                      
OL,6,GMotorists faced delays after a crash   
OL,7,Ginvolving an overturned vehicle closed 
OL,8,Gthe A14 in both directions.            
OL,10,FThe eastbound and westbound            
OL,11,Fcarriageways on the outskirts of       
OL,12,FIpswich were shut after an accident    
OL,13,Fbetween Seven Hills and the Nacton     
OL,14,FInterchange.                           
OL,16,FAccording to National Highways East    
OL,17,F"all emergency services" were on the   
OL,18,Fscene and there were two-mile queues   
OL,19,Fof traffic, causing delays of 30       
OL,20,Fminutes.                               
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
