OL,4,CFishing Buddies helps men talk about   
OL,5,Cmental health                          
OL,6,GA man with bowel cancer has said a     
OL,7,Gfishing group helped him after he      
OL,8,Gexperienced "loneliness" during his    
OL,9,Gchemotherapy.                          
OL,11,FBen Stone, 41, joined Fishing Buddies  
OL,12,Fafter he was diagnosed with cancer in  
OL,13,FOctober 2025, and experienced          
OL,14,F"loneliness during the week" while     
OL,15,Fhaving treatment.                      
OL,17,FThe programme is run by the Cambridge  
OL,18,FUnited Foundation and aims to help men 
OL,19,Fwho are experiencing mental health     
OL,20,Fchallenges through friendship and      
OL,21,Fsupport.                               
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
